{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/090a14f0a12a2d1bfbf413e7ddd92307f827a72f0c16792e954f2e726a973c394e10b342570093f2c0cdb50411e02a73b244c46eedfb9b89da9bb7ed90451abe","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KFWHe3vlbezGo_bepY7rgkm6x7zgcSJwMnis-wEEE3mJBRrg6N5OSxvew1CXA2RX_bs-x6rg00gAdMMHaaTffr0DsHtsBg7vyeshLg","width":600},"name":"Tobias Kunisch","title":"Design Lead, Google Fonts"},"document_id":5248938179035136,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>在过去的 10 年里，<a href=\"http://fonts.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Fonts 网站</a>已发展到收录超过 1,500 个字体家族、覆盖 1,000 多种语言，并包含 6,000 多个 Material Symbols（我们的可变图标集）。</p>\n<p>一个提供如此多选择的网站，需要更好的方式来探索、浏览、搜索并找到人们想要的资源。</p>\n<p>为了改善当下的用户体验，同时为未来的改进留出更多灵活性，我们对网站进行了多项更新。</p>\n<h2>更完善的网站导航</h2>\n<p>我们更新了网站导航，改用 Material 3 的<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/navigation-rail/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">侧边导航栏（Navigation Rail）</a>。就像<a href=\"https://Material.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Material.io</a> 上的侧边导航栏一样，它让你更方便地访问网站的几个主要板块：Fonts、Icons 和 Knowledge。你可能还注意到，我们把 Noto 提升到了侧边导航栏中，方便用户访问覆盖 150 多种不同书写系统的 Noto 字体家族。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>更佳的移动端体验</h2>\n<p>我们的新导航还通过<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/navigation-bar/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">底部导航栏</a>改善了移动端体验，让在小屏幕上切换板块变得更加舒适。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>搜索与筛选</h2>\n<p>值得注意的是，新版布局还引入了一个新的侧边栏。所有预览和筛选控件都在这里安家，帮助你为项目找到合适的字体或图标。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>所有筛选器现在都更容易找到，并按照有意义的方式分区，这种结构也方便我们日后继续添加更多筛选器。语言下拉菜单现在支持直接输入你要找的文字系统名称来筛选选项。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>在 Google Fonts Knowledge 板块，侧边栏帮助你在众多现有主题之间更好地定位。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=4&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>适用于浅色和深色模式的全新调色板</h2>\n<p>Google Fonts 团队是 Material 3 的忠实粉丝，因此我们更新了设计，在浅色和深色模式下都采用全新的 Material 3 配色方案。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=5&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>我们对 Google Fonts 网站的全新体验感到非常兴奋，你现在就可以在<a href=\"fonts.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fonts.google.com</a>上试用。四处逛逛，点击左下角的小对话气泡图标使用反馈功能，告诉我们你的想法。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"The new navigation rail","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/9e52eaa1c80da64f6335146af8c6c6404d86614cad72bfa0263bd58100d76b0afafd090a904349453f8fd3e82ae85fd5043dd039c7dd4a22b8df81ee9f4aa861","height":744,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/jRjxB2AYhTitgffDjlrO3Cqqz4Z1rjcKWv1FqeM1nIW2B6Xzs9Fr5yBYkiVvmZCH7aFy_UEDgN4QY4A231Jqa_YphJL26JJGkx11KwTwLzAeQfXQYQ","width":1384}},{"a11y_description":"New navigation on mobile","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/d371d26d3c19f8fcbb709124bb30b6a2f206285564b57da17f503b44c4328f1e2ce560111082a6bae7efd5d6b0e5df40d9d79c5abc08234c4aecd98d20366c28","height":818,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/xh2kedp-mfUz7091QEUo0mXCp5C05N6eMkEmOeQI93RPy7mCsL6JyAocn7IvHo52GBow01dcexFFwwVHIUNBTfajQBgVhGswO-0pIkEPtsSAdMckZLs","width":830}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"Customization, preview and search filter controls for fonts (left) and icons (right)","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/41b43fd7d7aac91fbfc78a35a4e0f286bc77162c10067576d210d74cd22df5b7d7a53b43abd53c8bb4bf9541a2546b3a89aaec686c368ad4b7e0f6a904079240","height":2370,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/5R7_3ENiRbeUFMZgU-Yn7nIV_2WxzRUIE9622RKzB43ZA460mMfbtAIYqD3tGVdeRcAADZpB-wtmbjJk3v1s_raCSl_cVfphU060xms_DYcflowaltQg","width":1644}},{"a11y_description":"Querying for the term “roboto” with filters for variable and monospace fonts applied","bordered":true,"caption":null,"